rnet banking, private client group, and other personalized banking products and services. In addition, it offers various trust and financial services comprising asset management services for individuals and corporate employee benefit plans, as well as brokerage services. Further, the company sells insurance products to retail and commercial customers. The company was formerly known as Rurban Financial Corp. and changed its name to SB Financial Group, Inc. in April 2013. SB Financial Group, Inc. was founded in 1902 and is based in Defiance, Ohio."}}